{"id": "t026-002", "text": "Afua's puppy arriving Sat!! cockapoo, called Biscuit. she's been puppy-proofing the whole flat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "puppy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arriving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo, called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t026-003", "text": "Eamon retiring end of month after 31 yrs @ the depot - longest serving there by miles. leaving do Thurs @ the Crown, 7ish. his wife Lena coming + the grandkids. he wants zero fuss, which means he secretly wants loads. collection going round, think a decent fishing reel. remind me to get a card the day before and get everyone on shift to sign it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "31 yrs @ the depot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "7ish", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandkids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "decent fishing reel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get everyone on shift to sign it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t026-016", "text": "Isaac - redundancy meeting Thurs 2pm w/ HR + his boss. really struggling w/ it, not sleeping, says he's been through it once already in 2019 and can't face job hunting again. wife pregnant w/ no. 2 so money worries on top. check in on him that evening, and maybe take him for a pint the weekend after whatever happens", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f9", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 2019"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't face job hunting", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "money worries", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t026-018", "text": "Antoine & his partner moving to Lyon for her new job - she's starting as a researcher @ the uni there. flights booked for 3rd. leaving party the Sat before @ theirs. they're rehoming the cat Fifi w/ his mum, which he's sad abt. he's not got work sorted yet, looking at teaching English. should send him that contact from the language school", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lyon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flights", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sat before", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rehoming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Fifi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking at teaching English", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that contact from the language school", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t026-023", "text": "Kai's mum retiring from teaching after 35 yrs, do @ the school next Fri afternoon. Kai giving a speech + he's dreading it, hates public speaking, already on draft 4. his brother Emeka was meant to do it but he's away w/ work. text Kai good luck that morning. she likes gardening, maybe a voucher for the garden centre", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring from teaching", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do @ the school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Fri afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates public speaking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emeka", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Kai good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gardening", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "voucher for the garden centre", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
